# TypeScript & Exports

- Named exports only — match filename
- `import type` for type-only imports
- No `any` without eslint-disable comment + TODO
- Types live in `src/types/` — never inline in consumers
- JSDoc on every exported symbol
- Options object if >3 parameters

## Naming

| What | Format |
|------|--------|
| Component / Type | PascalCase |
| Hook | `use` + PascalCase |
| Function | camelCase, verb-first |
| Constant | SCREAMING_SNAKE |
| Component file | `PascalCase.tsx` |
| Logic file | `camelCase.ts` |
| Types file | `*.types.ts` |
| Constants file | `*.constants.ts` |
| Event prop | `on` + PascalCase |
| Boolean prop | `is` / `has` / `can` |

## Import order

React → RN → Expo → third-party → types → constants → engine → store → hooks → components → styles
